  {
   "line": 8,
   "text": "The filter that makes it is the Hilbert transformer. It turns positive tones back a quarter turn and negative tones forward, so the line can still carry it. Turn that output one more quarter turn forward, and add the call. The top arrow lands on itself: doubled. The mirror lands opposite. Oh, gone.",
